 style=\"width: 50px;\"><span class=\"skin-dark-hide\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Info.png/50px-Info.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Info.png/75px-Info.png 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Info.png/100px-Info.png 2x\" /></span></span>\n<p><span class=\"skin-dark-show\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Info.png/50px-Info.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Info.png/75px-Info.png 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Info.png/100px-Info.png 2x\" /></span></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"mbox-text-cell\"><div class=\"mbox-header-div\" style=\"font-size: 130%\">Please help improve this page.</div><div class=\"mbox-note-div\" style=\"styles: css;\">You can help by editing this page. For suggestions, please see <a href=\"/edit/Item_talk:Chill_of_Winter_(level_23)?redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Item talk:Chill of Winter (level 23) (page does not exist)\">the talk page</a>, or embedded &lt;!-- comments --&gt; while <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ddowiki.com/edit/Item:Chill_of_Winter_(level_23)\">editing this page</a></span>.</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chill_of_Winter\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Chill_of_Winter\" title=\"Item:Chill of Winter\">Chill of Winter</a></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item currently cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a> and probably should be able to be.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #B1D3A0 solid; margin: 4px; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:var(--background-color-disabled-subtle, #D3D3D3);\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">23\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"13\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"width: 425px; background-color: #D3D3D3;\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cold_Bolts_icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cold_Bolts_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br /><a href=\"/page/Cold_Bolts\" title=\"Cold Bolts\">Cold Bolts</a>\n<table class=\"fakeClass\" style=\"width: 420px; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Target:</th><td>Foe, Directional, Breakable</td></tr>\n<tr><th>School:</th><td>Evocation</td></tr><tr><th>Spell Resistance:</th><td>No</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Description:</th><td>Fires ice crystals that damage your enemies. At higher levels multiple bolts are rapidly fired. Opponents struck by the crystals receive a Fortitude save for half damage.</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">&#160;</th></tr>\n<tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier I:</th><td>4 to 10 &#8203; + 1 to 2 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier II:</th><td>5 to 15 &#8203; + 1 to 4 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier III:</th><td>6 to 20 &#8203; + 1 to 6 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier IV:</th><td>7 to 25 &#8203; + 1 to 8 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier V:</th><td>8 to 30 &#8203; + 1 to 10 per Artificer Level</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Use\" title=\"Rune Arm Use\">Artificer Rune Arm Use</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Equip</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">280 / 280\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.abo